english translation text:
That Karbala, that night of loneliness, that darkness;
that grieving Zainab guarding the tents.
A rider approached the King's tents;
Ali's daughter advanced towards him in anguish.
The rider lifted the veil from his face;
before oppressed Zainab stood Ali.
Though Fatima's daughter was exceedingly patient,
this cry escaped her lips involuntarily.
Clinging to her father's feet, Zainab said:
Now you have come, Baba?
